{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many subsets are there for the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/d/d1de85186fd671391b8cb8af7e000f6f42f066af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A=\\{1,2,3,4,5,6,7\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"167\" height=\"18\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c587182f09cc2e618a5188608caf296f35ccafd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 7\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 14\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 49\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 64\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 128$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"387\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46b6968531c5b823549be28c0aba62428d9415a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\binom{7}{0}+\\binom{7}{1}+\\ldots+\\binom{7}{7}=2^7=128\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ E}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"343\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>